---
// How it works, shown as one review travelling through the gate: what the
// agent sends, what the reviewer changes, and what the agent gets back. The
// webhook panel follows the documented `review.decided` payload shape.
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="gw-moment gw-section-pad">
  <div class="gw-moment-eyebrow">How it works</div>
  <h2 class="gw-moment-title">One endpoint stands between the agent and the action.</h2>

  <ol class="gw-moment-grid">
    <li class="gw-moment-step">
      <div class="gw-moment-head">
        <span class="gw-moment-num">1</span>
        <span class="gw-moment-tag">POST /api/v1/reviews</span>
      </div>
      <p class="gw-moment-copy">Your agent submits work for review: a template slug and a payload. Two fields.</p>
      <pre class="gw-moment-code" aria-label="Request body the agent sends">&#123;
  <span class="k">"template"</span>: <span class="s">"campaign-launch"</span>,
  <span class="k">"payload"</span>: &#123;
    <span class="k">"daily_budget"</span>: <span class="n">500</span>,
    <span class="k">"audience"</span>: <span class="s">"Lookalike 2% · US"</span>
  &#125;
&#125;</pre>
    </li>

    <li class="gw-moment-step gw-moment-step-human">
      <div class="gw-moment-head">
        <span class="gw-moment-num">2</span>
        <span class="gw-moment-tag">structured form</span>
      </div>
      <p class="gw-moment-copy">A human reads the actual payload in a structured form and fixes what needs fixing.</p>
      <div class="gw-moment-form">
        <div class="gw-moment-field">
          <span class="gw-moment-label">daily_budget</span>
          <span class="gw-moment-value">
            <s>$500.00</s>
            <strong>$250.00</strong>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="gw-moment-edited">edited · agent proposed $500.00</div>
        <div class="gw-moment-field">
          <span class="gw-moment-label">audience</span>
          <span class="gw-moment-value">Lookalike 2% · US</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gw-moment-button">Launch campaign</div>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li class="gw-moment-step">
      <div class="gw-moment-head">
        <span class="gw-moment-num">3</span>
        <span class="gw-moment-tag">signed webhook</span>
      </div>
      <p class="gw-moment-copy">The decision returns over a signed webhook. The audit row is already written.</p>
      <pre class="gw-moment-code" aria-label="Webhook body the agent receives">&#123;
  <span class="k">"type"</span>: <span class="s">"review.decided"</span>,
  <span class="k">"decision"</span>: <span class="d">"approved"</span>,
  <span class="k">"was_edited"</span>: <span class="e">true</span>,
  <span class="k">"suggested_value"</span>: &#123;
    <span class="k">"daily_budget"</span>: <span class="n">500</span>
  &#125;,
  <span class="k">"approved_value"</span>: &#123;
    <span class="k">"daily_budget"</span>: <span class="d">250</span>
  &#125;,
  <span class="k">"reviewer"</span>: <span class="s">"alice@team.com"</span>
&#125;</pre>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .gw-moment {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 32px;
  }
  .gw-moment-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-label);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gw-label);
  }
  .gw-moment-title {
    font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-h2);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #f7f7f1;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .gw-moment-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin: 44px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .gw-moment-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid rgba(240, 240, 220, .08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: #201f1c;
    padding: 26px 24px 24px;
  }
  .gw-moment-step-human {
    border-color: rgba(33, 181, 113, .3);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(33, 181, 113, .07), rgba(33, 181, 113, .02)), #201f1c;
  }
  .gw-moment-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .gw-moment-num {
    font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-numeral);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gw-text-3);
  }
  .gw-moment-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-label);
    color: var(--gw-body-muted);
    background: rgba(240, 240, 220, .06);
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .gw-moment-copy {
    margin: 18px 0 20px;
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #e4e0d6;
  }
  .gw-moment-code,
  .gw-moment-form {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(240, 240, 220, .08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #141412;
  }
  .gw-moment-code {
    padding: 16px 18px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-code);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #cfcfc5;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .gw-moment-code .k { color: var(--gw-code-key); }
  .gw-moment-code .s,
  .gw-moment-code .n { color: var(--gw-code-value); }
  .gw-moment-code .d { color: var(--gw-decided); }
  .gw-moment-code .e { color: var(--gw-edited); }
  .gw-moment-form {
    padding: 16px 18px;
  }
  .gw-moment-field {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 6px 0;
  }
  .gw-moment-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-label);
    color: #8f887c;
  }
  .gw-moment-value {
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-small);
    color: #cfcfc5;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .gw-moment-value s {
    color: #8c8c83;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .gw-moment-value strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f7f7f1;
  }
  .gw-moment-edited {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-label);
    color: var(--gw-edited);
    text-align: right;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240, 240, 220, .06);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .gw-moment-button {
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #21b571;
    color: #08150e;
    font-size:var(--gw-fs-small);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .gw-moment-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .gw-moment-code,
    .gw-moment-form {
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .gw-moment {
      padding-top: 56px;
      padding-bottom: 56px;
    }
  }
</style>
